1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:01,810
August 10th, 1991.

2
00:00:01,830 --> 00:00:04,960
Ghost hunters photographed this empty gravestone.

3
00:00:05,110 --> 00:00:07,920
Bachelor's Grove Cemetery, outside Chicago.

4
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:11,620
Abandoned, inside a forest preserve, and badly vandalised.

5
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:15,390
Locals tell of floating lights, and a farmhouse that vanishes as you

6
00:00:15,410 --> 00:00:16,000
approach.

7
00:00:16,190 --> 00:00:20,400
That night, the Ghost Research Society said its equipment acted strangely here.

8
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:24,110
One member was shooting black-and-white infrared film in that spot.

9
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:26,460
Nobody saw anyone on the stone.

10
00:00:26,910 --> 00:00:28,490
Then the film was developed.

11
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:29,410
A woman.

12
00:00:29,430 --> 00:00:30,000
See-through.

13
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:32,740
Seated on the gravestone, in an old-fashioned dress.

14
00:00:33,070 --> 00:00:36,190
It became one of the most famous ghost photos ever taken.

15
00:00:36,470 --> 00:00:38,600
Sceptics suspect a double exposure:

16
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:40,190
two images on one frame.

17
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:42,360
Nobody has proved it either way.

18
00:00:43,310 --> 00:00:44,440
Or who she was.

